cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below, and cite the
  accompanying manuscript and data record listed in the README.
type: software
title: "CRC WNT-MAPK analysis workflow on the synthetic cohort"
abstract: >-
  Analysis workflow that computes the source data of 29 figure panels of "Mutation
  architectures define a WNT-MAPK transcriptional landscape in colorectal cancer" on the
  synthetic cohort deposited on Zenodo (https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23055294). It sets
  up a workspace with the synthetic cohort and the oncophenomap package and runs every
  panel. The synthetic cohort contains no real patients, and its results are not
  biological or clinical findings.
